From bf386a312180aaa33ebeb6937cc66f41828238ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 12:55:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Wedge windows setup: target carry per club+window
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

More → Wedge windows lets you define a target carry for each
club/window combination (e.g. 58° + 8 o'clock = 20m, 9 o'clock = 30m).
Stored in localStorage as tc_wedge_windows — no DB work needed.

- app.js: CRUD functions, renderWedgeWindowsSection(), getWedgeTarget()
  exposed globally; new 'wedgewindows' case in openMoreSection()
- index.html: Wedge windows button added to More menu list
- today.js: wedge window card now shows "+3m vs 20m" delta per row
  when a specific club is selected; "set target" hint with link to setup
- analysis.js: window display pill shows target carry next to it
- style.css: ww-table, ww-form, ww-delta chip styles

https://claude.ai/code/session_016UBmvSbRR1vd9nfCrs2Dfw
